-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
--  Legacy CNR catalogue seed
--
--  Extracted verbatim from src/cnr/nss/cnr_sql_init.nss before that script was
--  emptied. Kept as an archive only: nothing in the module runs it any more.
--
--  These statements target the OLD tables, recipe_metadata and
--  material_properties, which were seeded at every module load from NWScript.
--  They are consumed only by cnr_sql_c_item.nss, the pre-crafting hook of the
--  retired station scripts (cnranvilsmith, cnrjewelersbench, ...).
--
--  The live catalogue replaces them with cnr_recipe, cnr_recipe_component and
--  cnr_recipe_property, authored in migration/ and generated by
--  migration/build_catalogue.py. See documentation/oficios/cnr/schema.md.
--
--  Do NOT apply this file to the live database.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------


