-- Mithril - SpellFailure: -30%=4 -25%=5 -20%=6
-- The helmet cannot carry arcane spell failure reduction: itemprops.2da row 84
-- leaves column 7_Helm empty, so the property is rejected and the piece arrived
-- with its armour class alone. Reported from testing on 2026-08-23. The armour
-- and the shield keep theirs; only the helmet has no column for it. Replaced by
-- 15% slashing resistance, which a helmet does accept.

-- Adamantita - "Opuesto Fisico" is dynamic: the engine resolves it

-- Tier-4 pieces of 4 AC. The helmet of mithril carries 15% slashing instead of
-- spell failure for the same reason as its 5 AC counterpart: itemprops.2da
-- row 84 has no 7_Helm column.



